  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">M&#xE5;let med projektet &#xE4;r att utveckla expertis inom moldaviska finansmi teriet f&#xF6;r h&#xE5;llbar skuldhatering som m&#xF6;jligg&#xF6;r starkare st&#xE4;llning p&#xE5; internationella marknaden och fr&#xE4;mjar att Moldavien blir ett kreditv&#xE4; digt land. Peter Engstr&#xF6;m &amp; CoAB st&#xF6;djer att utveckla nya policies, strategier f&#xF6;r skuldhantering, know how etc</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Objective of programme is to develop expertise within the Ministry of Finance in Moldova for sustainable debt management and enable access to the international financial markets to ensure Moldovas internationacredit ratings. Peter Engstr&#xF6;m &amp; Co.AB will assist in creating new polstrategies with regards to debt man., transfer of knowledge.</narrative>
  </description>
